/E (Scratchpads help agents solve a task within a given session \(or thread\), but sometimes agents benefit from remembering things across many sessions! Reflexion introduced the idea of reflection following each agent turn and re-using these self-generated memories. Generative Agents created memories synthesized periodically from collections of past agent feedback.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4 5]
>>
endobj
