<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Agents use tools, but can become overloaded if they are provided with too many. This is often because the tool descriptions overlap, causing model confusion about which tool to use. One approach is to apply RAG \(retrieval augmented generation\) to tool descriptions in order to fetch only the most relevant tools for a task. Some recent papers have shown that this improve tool selection accuracy by 3-fold.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
