390 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (One common approach is to use a message list as your agent state and summarize or trim it periodically using a few built-in utilities. However, you can also add logic to post-process tool calls or work phases of your agent in a few different ways.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
